on in other areas.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.697
We have yet to talk to a
security team that told us

00:04:51.697 --> 00:04:53.530
that they have too much
time on their hands,

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.878
or they're too fully staffed.

00:04:55.878 --> 00:04:56.920
