aren't really adding value,

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.860
or aren't requiring all of
the expertise that you have,

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:21.760
so that you can invest that time
and expertise into other areas

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:24.990
