00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:24.470
This is really meant to
help you be proactive

00:11:24.470 --> 00:11:27.290
and to prevent issues
before they even happen.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.360
The second is the
Security dashboards,

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:32.630
which give you that high-level
overview of important metrics

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.160
in your organization.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:38.270
These also give you
actionable content

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:41.030
