help you detect issues.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.540
Then the Investigation
Tool, which

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.580
allows you to do
really advanced queries

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.860
to correlate data
across different types,

00:11:52.860 --> 00:11:55.360
