00:32:04.880 --> 00:32:08.270
So you can see here the
updated Terms of Service.

00:32:08.270 --> 00:32:10.430
They received it,
they opened it,

00:32:10.430 --> 00:32:12.710
and then they clicked
on a link, and it

00:32:12.710 --> 00:32:15.350
