00:32:15.350 --> 00:32:18.920
So we know that this
might be potentially

00:32:18.920 --> 00:32:20.458
how they were compromised.

00:32:20.458 --> 00:32:22.250
Now, what we can do
here is we can actually

00:32:22.250 --> 00:32:25.760
pivot on this message ID,
and we can see everyone

00:32:25.760 --> 00:32:27.860
in our organization
