00:32:27.860 --> 00:32:30.110
And so we'll look for everyone
in our organization who

00:32:30.110 --> 00:32:34.070
received this specific email to
make sure that no one else was

00:32:34.070 --> 00:32:36.400
compromised.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:40.390
And so we can see here, quite
