you through before.

00:35:34.680 --> 00:35:37.010
And so that's a
quick view of how

00:35:37.010 --> 00:35:41.090
you can use Data Loss
Prevention to prevent things

00:35:41.090 --> 00:35:42.800
before they even happen.

00:35:42.800 --> 00:35:44.750
How you can use
the logs associated

00:35:44.750 --> 00:35:48.380
with those to dig in,
detect, and remediate issues.

00:35:48.380 --> 00:35:51.120
And then how you can
go back to prevention.

00:35:51.120 --> 00:35:54.680
You can use the Activity Rules
within the Investigation Tool

00:35:54.680 --> 00:35:57.530
to use the same queries you
were using to prevent this

00:35:57.530 --> 00:36:00.740
