follow that loop of continuing

00:36:00.740 --> 00:36:03.470
to tailor your organization
so that you have less

00:36:03.470 --> 00:36:05.570
of these things
happening and you

00:36:05.570 --> 00:36:10.500
can prevent them from
happening in the first place.

00:36:10.500 --> 00:36:13.700
So with that, we
want to jump back

00:36:13.700 --> 00:36:21.440
