00:36:56.060 --> 00:36:58.220
if you're using other
tools to manage your alerts

00:36:58.220 --> 00:37:00.740
and to coordinate
your remediation.

00:37:00.740 --> 00:37:04.340
And so, we know that the APIs
are a very important part

00:37:04.340 --> 00:37:05.610
of this story.

00:37:05.610 --> 00:37:07.340
One of the things
that we wanted to do

00:37:07.340 --> 00:37:09.140
